[{"kind":"class","name":"LabelThemeLayer","tags":[{"originalTitle":"category","title":"category","text":"Visualization Theme","value":"Visualization Theme"}],"classdesc":"<p>标签专题图图层类。标签专题图是用文本形式在图层上直接显示属性表中的数据，实质上是对图层的标注。\n不仅帮助用户更好地区分地物要素，同时也显示了要素的某些重要属性，如行政区划、河流、机关、旅游景点的名称、等高线的高程等。</p>","modulecategory":{"globalParams":{"monospaceLinks":true,"cleverLinks":true,"default":{"outputSourceFiles":false},"namespace":"mapboxgl.supermap","moduleName":"mapboxgl","npm":"@supermapgis/iclient-mapboxgl","cdn":"https://iclient.supermap.io/dist/mapboxgl/iclient-mapboxgl.js"},"category":"Overlay","name":"mapboxgl.supermap.LabelThemeLayer","des_en":"LabelThemeLayer","className":"LabelThemeLayer","des":"标签专题图图层"},"params":[{"type":{"names":["string"]},"description":"<p>图层名。</p>","name":"name"},{"type":{"names":["Object"]},"description":"<p>参数。</p>","name":"options"},{"type":{"names":["mapboxgl.Map"]},"description":"<p>MapBoxGL Map 对象。</p>","name":"options.map"},{"type":{"names":["string"]},"description":"<p>指定创建专题图字段。</p>","name":"options.themeField"},{"type":{"names":["Object"]},"description":"<p>专题图样式。</p>","name":"options.style"},{"type":{"names":["Object"]},"description":"<p>各专题类型样式组。</p>","name":"options.styleGroups"},{"type":{"names":["Object"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>hover 的高亮样式。</p>","name":"options.highlightStyle"},{"type":{"names":["string"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>专题图层 ID。专题图层 ID。默认使用 CommonUtil.createUniqueID(&quot;themeLayer_&quot;) 创建专题图层 ID。</p>","name":"options.id"},{"type":{"names":["boolean"]},"optional":true,"defaultvalue":true,"description":"<p>是否实时重绘。</p>","name":"options.loadWhileAnimating"},{"type":{"names":["number"]},"optional":true,"defaultvalue":1,"description":"<p>图层不透明度。</p>","name":"options.opacity"},{"type":{"names":["boolean"]},"optional":true,"defaultvalue":true,"description":"<p>是否进行地图边缘的避让处理。</p>","name":"options.isAvoid"},{"type":{"names":["boolean"]},"optional":true,"defaultvalue":true,"description":"<p>是否进行压盖处理，如果设为 true，图表绘制过程中将隐藏对已在图层中绘制的图表产生压盖的图表。</p>","name":"options.isOverLay"},{"type":{"names":["boolean"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>是否开启 hover 事件。</p>","name":"options.isHoverAble"}],"augments":["GeoFeatureThemeLayer"],"usage":{"className":"LabelThemeLayer","aliasClass":"","globalParams":{"monospaceLinks":true,"cleverLinks":true,"default":{"outputSourceFiles":false},"namespace":"mapboxgl.supermap","moduleName":"mapboxgl","npm":"@supermapgis/iclient-mapboxgl","cdn":"https://iclient.supermap.io/dist/mapboxgl/iclient-mapboxgl.js"},"deprecatedClasses":[],"deprecatedClassInstance":null,"browserNamespace":""},"longname":"LabelThemeLayer","scope":"global","usageCodeBrowser":"<script type='text/javascript' src=\"https://iclient.supermap.io/dist/mapboxgl/iclient-mapboxgl.js\"></script>\n<script>\n  new mapboxgl.supermap.LabelThemeLayer(name, options, options.map, options.themeField, options.style, options.styleGroups, options.highlightStyle, options.id, options.loadWhileAnimating, options.opacity, options.isAvoid, options.isOverLay, options.isHoverAble);\n</script>","usageCodeES6":"import { LabelThemeLayer } from '@supermapgis/iclient-mapboxgl';\n\nnew LabelThemeLayer(name, options, options.map, options.themeField, options.style, options.styleGroups, options.highlightStyle, options.id, options.loadWhileAnimating, options.opacity, options.isAvoid, options.isOverLay, options.isHoverAble);"},{"kind":"member","name":"isOverLay","type":{"names":["boolean"]},"optional":true,"defaultvalue":true,"description":"<p>是否进行压盖处理，如果设为 true，将隐藏被压盖的标签。</p>","memberof":"LabelThemeLayer","longname":"LabelThemeLayer#isOverLay","scope":"instance"},{"kind":"member","name":"isAvoid","type":{"names":["boolean"]},"optional":true,"defaultvalue":true,"description":"<p>是否进行地图边缘的避让处理，如果设为 true，将把与地图边缘相交的标签移到地图范围内，在地图边缘处做避让处理。</p>","memberof":"LabelThemeLayer","longname":"LabelThemeLayer#isAvoid","scope":"instance"},{"kind":"member","name":"themeField","type":{"names":["string"]},"description":"<p>用于指定专题要素样式的属性字段名称。</br>\n此属性字段是要用户数据（feature） attributes 中包含的字段，且字段对应的值的类型必须是数值型。</br>\n使用标签分组显示还需要设置 styleGroups 属性。</p>","memberof":"LabelThemeLayer","longname":"LabelThemeLayer#themeField","scope":"instance"},{"kind":"member","name":"styleGroups","type":{"names":["Array.<Object>"]},"description":"<p>分组样式。使用此属性需要设置 themeField 属性。</br>\n1.没有同时设置 themeField 和 styleGroups，则所有专题要素都使用本图层的 style 进行渲染；</br>\n2.同时设置 themeField 和 styleGroups，则按照 themeField 指定的字段名称获取用户数据（feature）attributes 中对应的属性值；</br>\n  a.如果属性值等于 styleGroups 数组里某个元素定义的 value 值，则此专题要素取 styleGroups 数组中该元素定义的 style 进行渲染。</br>\n  b.如果属性值不等于 styleGroups 数组里任何元素定义的 value 值，则此专题要素按照本图层的 style 进行渲染。</br>\n此数组每个元素对象必须有两个属性：value : 与字段 themeField 相对应的属性值；style：专题要素 style。</p>","memberof":"LabelThemeLayer","longname":"LabelThemeLayer#styleGroups","scope":"instance"},{"kind":"function","name":"redrawThematicFeatures","description":"<p>重绘所有专题要素。</br>\n此方法包含绘制专题要素的所有步骤，包含用户数据到专题要素的转换，抽稀，缓存等步骤。</br>\n地图漫游时调用此方法进行图层刷新。</p>","params":[{"type":{"names":["mapboxgl.LngLatBounds"]},"description":"<p>重绘范围。</p>","name":"bounds"}],"memberof":"LabelThemeLayer","longname":"LabelThemeLayer#redrawThematicFeatures","scope":"instance","overrides":"GeoFeatureThemeLayer#redrawThematicFeatures"},{"kind":"function","name":"removeFeatures","description":"<p>从专题图中删除要素。这个函数删除所有传递进来的矢量要素。</p>","params":[{"type":{"names":["Array.<FeatureVector>","FeatureVector","function"]},"description":"<p>要删除的要素对象或用于过滤的回调函数。</p>","name":"features"}],"memberof":"LabelThemeLayer","longname":"LabelThemeLayer#removeFeatures","scope":"instance","overrides":"GeoFeatureThemeLayer#removeFeatures"},{"kind":"function","name":"removeAllFeatures","description":"<p>清除当前图层所有的矢量要素。</p>","memberof":"LabelThemeLayer","longname":"LabelThemeLayer#removeAllFeatures","scope":"instance","overrides":"GeoFeatureThemeLayer#removeAllFeatures"},{"kind":"function","name":"createThematicFeature","description":"<p>创建专题图要素。</p>","params":[{"type":{"names":["Object"]},"description":"<p>要创建的专题图形要素。</p>","name":"feature"}],"memberof":"LabelThemeLayer","longname":"LabelThemeLayer#createThematicFeature","scope":"instance","overrides":"GeoFeatureThemeLayer#createThematicFeature"},{"kind":"function","name":"getDrawnLabels","description":"<p>获取经（压盖）处理后将要绘制在图层上的标签要素。</p>","params":[{"type":{"names":["Array.<FeatureVector>"]},"description":"<p>所有标签要素的数组。</p>","name":"labelFeatures"}],"returns":[{"type":{"names":["Array.<FeatureVector>"]},"description":"<p>最终要绘制的标签要素数组。</p>"}],"memberof":"LabelThemeLayer","longname":"LabelThemeLayer#getDrawnLabels","scope":"instance"},{"kind":"function","name":"getStyleByData","description":"<p>根据用户数据（feature）设置专题要素的风格。</p>","params":[{"type":{"names":["FeatureVector"]},"description":"<p>矢量要素对象。</p>","name":"feat"}],"returns":[{"type":{"names":["Array.<ThemeStyle>"]},"description":"<p>专题要素的风格。</p>"}],"memberof":"LabelThemeLayer","longname":"LabelThemeLayer#getStyleByData","scope":"instance"},{"kind":"function","name":"setLabelsStyle","description":"<p>设置标签要素的 Style。</p>","params":[{"type":{"names":["Array.<FeatureVector>"]},"description":"<p>需要设置 Style 的标签要素数组。</p>","name":"labelFeatures"}],"returns":[{"type":{"names":["Array.<FeatureVector>"]},"description":"<p>赋予 Style 后的标签要素数组。</p>"}],"memberof":"LabelThemeLayer","longname":"LabelThemeLayer#setLabelsStyle","scope":"instance"},{"kind":"function","name":"setStyle","description":"<p>设置标签要素的Style。</p>","params":[{"type":{"names":["FeatureVector"]},"description":"<p>需要赋予 style 的要素。</p>","name":"feat"}],"memberof":"LabelThemeLayer","longname":"LabelThemeLayer#setStyle","scope":"instance"},{"kind":"function","name":"getLabelPxLocation","description":"<p>获取标签要素的像素坐标。</p>","params":[{"type":{"names":["FeatureVector"]},"description":"<p>标签要素。</p>","name":"feature"}],"returns":[{"type":{"names":["mapboxgl.Point"]},"description":"<p>标签位置。</p>"}],"memberof":"LabelThemeLayer","longname":"LabelThemeLayer#getLabelPxLocation","scope":"instance"},{"kind":"function","name":"calculateLabelBounds","description":"<p>获得标签要素的最终范围。</p>","params":[{"type":{"names":["FeatureVector"]},"description":"<p>需要计算范围的标签要素数。</p>","name":"feature"},{"type":{"names":["mapboxgl.Point"]},"description":"<p>标签位置。</p>","name":"loc"}],"returns":[{"type":{"names":["Array.<Object>"]},"description":"<p>四边形节点数组。例如：[{&quot;x&quot;:1,&quot;y&quot;:1},{&quot;x&quot;:3,&quot;y&quot;:1},{&quot;x&quot;:6,&quot;y&quot;:4},{&quot;x&quot;:2,&quot;y&quot;:10},{&quot;x&quot;:1,&quot;y&quot;:1}]。</p>"}],"memberof":"LabelThemeLayer","longname":"LabelThemeLayer#calculateLabelBounds","scope":"instance"},{"kind":"function","name":"calculateLabelBounds2","description":"<p>获得标签要素的最终范围的另一种算法（通过记录下的标签宽高），提高计算范围的效率。</p>","params":[{"type":{"names":["FeatureVector"]},"description":"<p>需要计算范围的标签要素数。</p>","name":"feature"},{"type":{"names":["mapboxgl.Point"]},"description":"<p>标签位置。</p>","name":"loc"}],"returns":[{"type":{"names":["Array.<Object>"]},"description":"<p>四边形节点数组。例如：[{&quot;x&quot;:1,&quot;y&quot;:1},{&quot;x&quot;:3,&quot;y&quot;:1},{&quot;x&quot;:6,&quot;y&quot;:4},{&quot;x&quot;:2,&quot;y&quot;:10},{&quot;x&quot;:1,&quot;y&quot;:1}]。</p>"}],"memberof":"LabelThemeLayer","longname":"LabelThemeLayer#calculateLabelBounds2","scope":"instance"},{"kind":"function","name":"getLabelInfo","description":"<p>根据当前位置获取绘制后的标签信息，包括标签的宽，高和行数等。</p>","returns":[{"type":{"names":["Object"]},"description":"<p>绘制后的标签信息。</p>"}],"memberof":"LabelThemeLayer","longname":"LabelThemeLayer#getLabelInfo","scope":"instance"},{"kind":"function","name":"rotationBounds","description":"<p>旋转 bounds。</p>","params":[{"type":{"names":["Bounds"]},"description":"<p>要旋转的 bounds。</p>","name":"bounds"},{"type":{"names":["Object"]},"description":"<p>旋转中心点对象，此对象含有属性X（横坐标），属性Y（纵坐标）。</p>","name":"rotationCenterPoi"},{"type":{"names":["number"]},"description":"<p>旋转角度（顺时针）。</p>","name":"angle"}],"returns":[{"type":{"names":["Array.<Object>"]},"description":"<p>bounds 旋转后形成的多边形节点数组。是一个四边形，形如：[{&quot;x&quot;:1,&quot;y&quot;:1},{&quot;x&quot;:3,&quot;y&quot;:1},{&quot;x&quot;:6,&quot;y&quot;:4},{&quot;x&quot;:2,&quot;y&quot;:10},{&quot;x&quot;:1,&quot;y&quot;:1}]</p>"}],"memberof":"LabelThemeLayer","longname":"LabelThemeLayer#rotationBounds","scope":"instance"},{"kind":"function","name":"getRotatedLocation","description":"<p>获取一个点绕旋转中心顺时针旋转后的位置（此方法用于屏幕坐标）。</p>","params":[{"type":{"names":["number"]},"description":"<p>旋转点横坐标。</p>","name":"x"},{"type":{"names":["number"]},"description":"<p>旋转点纵坐标。</p>","name":"y"},{"type":{"names":["number"]},"description":"<p>旋转中心点横坐标。</p>","name":"rx"},{"type":{"names":["number"]},"description":"<p>旋转中心点纵坐标。</p>","name":"ry"},{"type":{"names":["number"]},"description":"<p>旋转角度。</p>","name":"angle"}],"returns":[{"type":{"names":["Object"]},"description":"<p>旋转后的坐标位置对象，该对象含有属性X（横坐标），属性Y（纵坐标）。</p>"}],"memberof":"LabelThemeLayer","longname":"LabelThemeLayer#getRotatedLocation","scope":"instance"},{"kind":"function","name":"getAvoidInfo","description":"<p>获取避让的信息。</p>","params":[{"type":{"names":["Bounds"]},"description":"<p>地图像素范围。</p>","name":"bounds"},{"type":{"names":["Array.<Object>"]},"description":"<p>四边形节点数组。例如：[{&quot;x&quot;:1,&quot;y&quot;:1},{&quot;x&quot;:3,&quot;y&quot;:1},{&quot;x&quot;:6,&quot;y&quot;:4},{&quot;x&quot;:2,&quot;y&quot;:10},{&quot;x&quot;:1,&quot;y&quot;:1}]。</p>","name":"quadrilateral"}],"returns":[{"type":{"names":["Object"]},"description":"<p>避让的信息。</p>"}],"memberof":"LabelThemeLayer","longname":"LabelThemeLayer#getAvoidInfo","scope":"instance"},{"kind":"function","name":"isQuadrilateralOverLap","description":"<p>判断两个四边形是否有压盖。</p>","params":[{"type":{"names":["Array.<Object>"]},"description":"<p>四边形节点数组。例如：[{&quot;x&quot;:1,&quot;y&quot;:1},{&quot;x&quot;:3,&quot;y&quot;:1},{&quot;x&quot;:6,&quot;y&quot;:4},{&quot;x&quot;:2,&quot;y&quot;:10},{&quot;x&quot;:1,&quot;y&quot;:1}]。</p>","name":"quadrilateral"},{"type":{"names":["Array.<Object>"]},"description":"<p>第二个四边形节点数组。</p>","name":"quadrilateral2"}],"returns":[{"type":{"names":["boolean"]},"description":"<p>是否压盖，true 表示压盖。</p>"}],"memberof":"LabelThemeLayer","longname":"LabelThemeLayer#isQuadrilateralOverLap","scope":"instance"},{"kind":"function","name":"isPointInPoly","description":"<p>判断一个点是否在多边形里面（射线法）。</p>","params":[{"type":{"names":["Object"]},"description":"<p>需要判定的点对象，该对象含有属性x（横坐标），属性y（纵坐标）。</p>","name":"pt"},{"type":{"names":["Array.<Object>"]},"description":"<p>多边形节点数组。例如一个四边形：[{&quot;x&quot;:1,&quot;y&quot;:1},{&quot;x&quot;:3,&quot;y&quot;:1},{&quot;x&quot;:6,&quot;y&quot;:4},{&quot;x&quot;:2,&quot;y&quot;:10},{&quot;x&quot;:1,&quot;y&quot;:1}]。</p>","name":"poly"}],"returns":[{"type":{"names":["boolean"]},"description":"<p>点是否在多边形内。</p>"}],"memberof":"LabelThemeLayer","longname":"LabelThemeLayer#isPointInPoly","scope":"instance"}]